  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    text: I found this strange object near the tent. What is it?
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'Get that away from me right now! '
  - speaker: 0
    text: "But... what\u2019s the problem with this thing?"
  - speaker: 1
    text: It is not dangerous in and of itself. It only attracts people that are
      dangerous.
  - speaker: 1
    text: People who would do anything to have it in their possession.
  - speaker: 0
    text: But what should I do with it?
  - speaker: 1
    text: Hide it! As best you can, your life depends on it ...
